graph TD
    %% Input Signals
    A[L-Arabinose in Medium] --> B[Arabinose Transport]
    C[Glucose Status] --> D[cAMP Levels]
    
    %% Transport
    B --> E[AraE Transporter]
    E --> F[Arabinose Inside Cell]
    
    %% Decision: Arabinose Present?
    F --> G{Arabinose Present?}
    
    %% No Arabinose - Repression
    G -->|No| H[AraC Apo-form]
    H --> I[AraC Dimer]
    I --> J[AraC Binds araO2 and araI1]
    J --> K[DNA Loop Formation]
    K --> L[Promoter Occluded]
    L --> M[\Transcription Repressed/]
    M --> N[No ara Gene Expression]
    N --> O[Basal State]
    
    %% Arabinose Present - Conformational Change
    G -->|Yes| P[Arabinose Binds AraC]
    P --> Q[AraC Conformational Change]
    Q --> R[DNA Loop Breaks]
    R --> S[AraC Releases araO2]
    S --> T[AraC Binds araI1 and araI2]
    T --> U[AraC as Activator]
    
    %% Decision: Glucose Status
    D --> V{High cAMP?}
    
    %% AND Gate: Full Activation
    U --> ANDGATE1{AraC-Ara Active AND<br/>CRP-cAMP Present?}
    V -->|Yes| W[CRP-cAMP Complex]
    W --> ANDGATE1
    
    %% Activation
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| X[CRP Binds araI Site]
    X --> Y[AraC-CRP Cooperative Binding]
    Y --> Z[RNAP Recruitment]
    Z --> AA[Strong Transcription]
    
    %% araBAD Operon Expression
    AA --> AB[araBAD mRNA Synthesis]
    AB --> AC[araB mRNA]
    AB --> AD[araA mRNA]
    AB --> AE[araD mRNA]
    
    %% Translation
    AC --> AF[AraB Translation]
    AD --> AG[AraA Translation]
    AE --> AH[AraD Translation]
    
    %% Enzyme Production
    AF --> AI[Ribulokinase AraB]
    AG --> AJ[Arabinose Isomerase AraA]
    AH --> AK[Ribulose-5-P Epimerase AraD]
    
    %% Arabinose Metabolism
    F --> AL[L-Arabinose Substrate]
    AJ --> AM[/Arabinose to Ribulose/]
    AL --> AM
    AM --> AN(\1)
    AI --> AO[Ribulose to Ribulose-5-P]
    AN --> AO
    AO --> AP[L-Ribulose-5-phosphate]
    AK --> AQ[Ribulose-5-P to Xylulose-5-P]
    AP --> AQ
    AQ --> AR[D-Xylulose-5-phosphate]
    
    %% Entry to Central Metabolism
    AR --> AS[Pentose Phosphate Pathway]
    AS --> AT(\1)
    AT --> AU[Energy Production]
    
    %% Catabolite Repression Path
    V -->|No| AV[Low cAMP]
    AV --> AW[\CRP Inactive/]
    AW --> AX[/Weak Transcription/]
    AX --> AY[Limited ara Expression]
    AY --> AZ[Glucose Preference]
    
    %% AND Gate: araC Autoregulation
    U --> ANDGATE2{AraC-Ara AND<br/>araC Promoter?}
    T --> ANDGATE2
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| BA[araC Gene Transcription]
    BA --> BB[More AraC Protein]
    BB --> H
    
    %% System Outputs
    O --> BC[Arabinose Utilization Off]
    AU --> BD[Arabinose Catabolism]
    AZ --> BE[Glucose-Preferential Growth]
    
